81
00:01:50,257 --> 00:01:53,887
How long are you going to keep running, Black Hero?

82
00:01:53,887 --> 00:01:55,827
I thought you were supposed to stop me.

83
00:01:56,637 --> 00:02:00,187
The Giant is right there in front of Crossfeed!

84
00:02:02,947 --> 00:02:06,667
You people fell right into our trap.

85
00:02:07,307 --> 00:02:11,527
If my intel is right, you won't be able to use Bahamut
 for more than a few minutes in your current state!

86
00:02:11,977 --> 00:02:16,197
So that's why you lured me into it!

87
00:02:16,197 --> 00:02:18,537
Your time should be just about up.

88
00:02:18,537 --> 00:02:21,167
End of the line for you people!

89
00:02:25,167 --> 00:02:26,377
Howling Roar!

90
00:02:29,087 --> 00:02:31,047
A meaningless effort!

91
00:02:38,877 --> 00:02:40,227
That arm...

92
00:02:40,227 --> 00:02:42,737
It's not Bahamut's!

93
00:02:48,757 --> 00:02:49,777
How?!

94
00:02:49,777 --> 00:02:52,317
How do you have two Bahamuts?!

95
00:02:52,797 --> 00:02:56,987
The other Machine Dragon was a Wyvern made to look like Bahamut.

96
00:02:57,387 --> 00:03:01,827
I had a backup plan in case
 something went south.

97
00:03:03,247 --> 00:03:04,917
Why you little...

98
00:03:15,837 --> 00:03:19,697
That's the fifth ruin,
 commonly known as the Giant.

99
00:03:19,697 --> 00:03:23,517
We can't have an All Dragons Battle
 with this at our doorstep.

100
00:03:24,467 --> 00:03:25,947
Airi! Do you read me?

101
00:03:25,947 --> 00:03:27,977
Lux! You're all right?

102
00:03:28,497 --> 00:03:29,757
Thank goodness.

103
00:03:29,757 --> 00:03:32,367
Yes. How about you guys?

104
00:03:32,367 --> 00:03:34,697
Lux, I have something to tell you.

105
00:03:35,417 --> 00:03:36,667
It's about Miss Lisha.

106
00:03:47,877 --> 00:03:50,667
Long time no see, Your Highness.

107
00:03:51,497 --> 00:03:53,207
Saniya!

108
00:03:53,207 --> 00:03:54,637
Can you see that?

109
00:04:06,227 --> 00:04:07,887
They're an eyesore.

110
00:04:07,887 --> 00:04:09,447
Make them disappear.

111
00:04:09,447 --> 00:04:11,437
Yes, Creator.

112
00:04:21,287 --> 00:04:25,967
As you can see, it's only a matter of time
 before the new kingdom falls.

113
00:04:27,827 --> 00:04:33,367
Miss Hayes has ordered you, as a princess,
 to serve as a negotiator,

114
00:04:33,367 --> 00:04:37,807
so that we can avoid needless casualties in this war.

115
00:04:37,807 --> 00:04:41,347
I'll never let people like you have this kingdom!

116
00:04:42,657 --> 00:04:46,057
No need put on a tough front for me.

117
00:04:46,057 --> 00:04:49,057
I know you're a traitor who once sided with the former empire.

118
00:04:50,527 --> 00:04:54,397
But he accepted me despite that.

119
00:04:55,407 --> 00:04:57,787
He said he'll fight by my side.

120
00:05:00,197 --> 00:05:04,157
I hear there's something interesting to see
 on the stomach of the princess.

121
00:05:04,597 --> 00:05:06,847
Disrobe her so we can have a look.

122
00:05:12,617 --> 00:05:16,967
<i>Please, save me, Lux.</i>

123
00:05:28,517 --> 00:05:29,677
Lux!

124
00:05:30,307 --> 00:05:31,767
You again?!

125
00:05:31,767 --> 00:05:33,277
Lux Arcadia.

126
00:05:33,647 --> 00:05:34,877
Fine, then.

127
00:05:34,877 --> 00:05:38,267
There are plenty of others we could take hostage.

128
00:05:42,507 --> 00:05:44,947
Sorry to keep you waiting, Miss Lisha.

129
00:05:45,947 --> 00:05:49,847
I... I'm too ashamed to face you.

130
00:05:50,757 --> 00:05:55,167
I lost control in the All Dragons Battle,
 and failed our kingdom.

131
00:05:55,967 --> 00:05:57,717
That was a trap set by Hayes.

132
00:05:57,717 --> 00:05:58,917
I know!

133
00:05:58,917 --> 00:06:00,887
But that doesn't mean anything!

134
00:06:01,317 --> 00:06:04,307
Because of me, the efforts of everyone who fought for the kingdomâ

135
00:06:05,587 --> 00:06:10,807
your effortsâall went to waste.

136
00:06:10,807 --> 00:06:13,817
Thank you for thinking of me.

137
00:06:14,477 --> 00:06:16,167
But it's okay.

138
00:06:16,167 --> 00:06:19,817
Even if no one in this kingdom or in this world accepts me,

139
00:06:20,427 --> 00:06:23,377
so long as you accept me, I can fight.

140
00:06:25,987 --> 00:06:29,277
I need your strength, Miss Lisha.

141
00:06:30,567 --> 00:06:33,747
So that this time, 
I can protect us and this kingdom.

142
00:06:35,717 --> 00:06:36,917
Miss Lisha.

143
00:06:40,937 --> 00:06:42,517
Let's go, Lux.

144
00:06:46,027 --> 00:06:47,377
I'm warning you.

145
00:06:47,377 --> 00:06:49,707
This fight has already been decided.

146
00:06:49,707 --> 00:06:53,357
The new kingdom's army
 is to surrender immediately.

147
00:06:53,827 --> 00:06:56,857
Anyone who doesn't heed this warning will be exterminated.

148
00:06:59,067 --> 00:07:02,257
So someone managed to
 survive our previous attack.

149
00:07:03,347 --> 00:07:04,667
Fafnir?

150
00:07:04,667 --> 00:07:06,207
Makes sense.

151
00:07:06,207 --> 00:07:08,657
She used her premonition ability, Wise Blood.

152
00:07:09,117 --> 00:07:14,087
Turn all cannons to her,
 so she has nowhere to hide!

153
00:07:16,447 --> 00:07:17,207
What?!

154
00:07:21,997 --> 00:07:24,007
The monster girl, huh?

155
00:07:24,007 --> 00:07:25,897
Get lost, maggots!

156
00:07:25,897 --> 00:07:29,317
You can't stop my giant with that!

157
00:07:36,887 --> 00:07:42,087
All you can do is watch as I destroy Crossfeed!

158
00:07:42,087 --> 00:07:44,067
Grovel before the name of God!

159
00:07:44,067 --> 00:07:46,027
Thresher!

160
00:07:50,527 --> 00:07:54,587
So the dishonored princess has come
 to show more of her disgrace.

161
00:07:54,587 --> 00:07:55,707
Shut up!

162
00:07:55,707 --> 00:07:58,917
You'll pay for what you've done to me and to this kingdom!

163
00:08:01,197 --> 00:08:03,107
Don't get too full of yourself.

164
00:08:03,107 --> 00:08:06,597
Did you think you could stop the Giant with such a simple trick?

165
00:08:13,717 --> 00:08:14,797
Lux!

166
00:08:14,797 --> 00:08:15,977
Miss Lisha.

167
00:08:15,977 --> 00:08:20,687
I'm going to strengthen Tiamat's Thresher using Reload on Fire.

168
00:08:20,687 --> 00:08:22,287
Is that evenâ

169
00:08:22,287 --> 00:08:23,527
It is possible!

170
00:08:24,197 --> 00:08:25,737
The two of us can do it.

171
00:08:27,787 --> 00:08:28,787
All right!

172
00:08:28,787 --> 00:08:29,697
We're doing it!

173
00:08:30,317 --> 00:08:31,617
Let's go, Lux!

174
00:08:31,617 --> 00:08:32,757
Yes!

175
00:08:32,757 --> 00:08:36,477
Reload on Fire!

176
00:08:36,477 --> 00:08:39,577
Grovel before the names of God and the dragon king!

177
00:08:46,337 --> 00:08:48,297
Thresher!

178
00:08:53,577 --> 00:08:54,287
Phi!

179
00:08:54,287 --> 00:08:55,557
Krulcifer!

180
00:08:58,307 --> 00:09:00,147
Freezing Cannon!

181
00:09:04,607 --> 00:09:07,737
Creator, we have been rendered immobile.

182
00:09:08,197 --> 00:09:12,697
It will take a little over ten minutes
 to restore optimal running conditions.

183
00:09:18,087 --> 00:09:19,877
Good work, Lux!

184
00:09:19,877 --> 00:09:22,877
But the rebel army is still inside the city.

185
00:09:22,877 --> 00:09:24,837
All right, then.

186
00:09:25,447 --> 00:09:32,557
Phi, Krulcifer, please deal with the
 Gargoyles and rebel forces inside the city.

187
00:09:33,037 --> 00:09:36,007
Miss Lisha and I are going inside the Giant.

188
00:09:36,007 --> 00:09:36,997
All right.

189
00:09:37,857 --> 00:09:39,727
Be careful, Lu.

190
00:09:39,727 --> 00:09:41,887
Thanks. I will.

191
00:09:41,887 --> 00:09:42,787
Lux.

192
00:09:43,727 --> 00:09:45,037
It's time to settle this.

193
00:09:45,037 --> 00:09:45,687
Yes.

194
00:09:46,417 --> 00:09:48,307
I've never felt like this before.

195
00:09:48,307 --> 00:09:51,777
Having you by my side inspires unexpected confidence in me.

196
00:09:53,737 --> 00:09:54,577
Look out!

197
00:10:01,087 --> 00:10:03,047
That split the city in half!

198
00:10:04,187 --> 00:10:05,827
Sorry for the late introduction.

199
00:10:08,957 --> 00:10:11,547
This is my Divine Raiment Machine Dragon,

200
00:10:12,177 --> 00:10:14,057
NÃ­Ã°hÃ¶ggr!

201
00:10:16,977 --> 00:10:16,977


202
00:10:33,607 --> 00:10:35,337
Who are you, wench?

203
00:10:35,337 --> 00:10:37,317
Silence, aristocrat swine!

204
00:10:38,287 --> 00:10:41,407
You have no right to question me.

205
00:10:41,407 --> 00:10:44,027
Obey us, or be exterminated.

206
00:10:48,497 --> 00:10:50,177
Celistia?

207
00:10:50,177 --> 00:10:52,167
I came to get back at...

208
00:10:52,167 --> 00:10:54,807
No. I came to take responsibility for my previous failure.

209
00:10:55,717 --> 00:10:59,637
What can you hope to accomplish, Celis?

210
00:11:03,917 --> 00:11:09,727
I used to think I understood you,
 but I was wrong.

211
00:11:10,697 --> 00:11:14,617
That's why I'm going to settle this now!

212
00:11:15,097 --> 00:11:16,657
Astral Rain!

213
00:11:21,477 --> 00:11:22,747
Stop!

214
00:11:22,747 --> 00:11:26,707
Who in the world are you
 and what are you fighting for?

215
00:11:28,547 --> 00:11:32,427
I'll tell you... as I hold your execution!

216
00:11:34,957 --> 00:11:36,567
What's wrong, princess?

217
00:11:36,567 --> 00:11:38,897
Is that all you can do by yourself?

218
00:11:39,547 --> 00:11:39,977
<i>Wait...</i>

219
00:11:40,927 --> 00:11:42,557
<i>Where's Bahamut?</i>

220
00:11:43,227 --> 00:11:45,437
<i>Could he have gone to
 the Giant's control room?!</i>

221
00:11:49,647 --> 00:11:50,947
Seven Heads, huh?

222
00:11:51,517 --> 00:11:54,437
You're not worth the Black Hero's time.

223
00:11:54,437 --> 00:11:57,577
I can take care of you by myself!

224
00:11:57,577 --> 00:11:58,697
Scoundrel!

225
00:11:59,447 --> 00:12:02,327
You pathetic excuse for a princess!

226
00:12:07,747 --> 00:12:10,737
I need to find an entrance.

227
00:12:16,417 --> 00:12:19,937
I've been expecting you, Master.

228
00:12:19,937 --> 00:12:25,347
Unfortunately, it seems you
 have not changed your mind.

229
00:12:25,877 --> 00:12:30,347
In that case, I'll have to defeat you, Master,

230
00:12:30,347 --> 00:12:32,567
and restore the empire under your sister.

231
00:12:33,297 --> 00:12:37,567
I'm sorry, but I seem to have
 found a reason to fight you too.

232
00:12:37,567 --> 00:12:38,527
And what is that?

233
00:12:39,177 --> 00:12:41,477
To save you.

234
00:12:48,747 --> 00:12:52,237
Why are you hellbent on restoring the empire?

235
00:12:52,237 --> 00:12:57,797
As I explained before, I wish to honor
 the pact I made for my brother.

236
00:12:57,797 --> 00:13:00,587
Then why was your brother killed?

237
00:13:02,287 --> 00:13:06,577
That's an curious thing to ask,
 given these circumstances.

238
00:13:06,577 --> 00:13:08,727
I think I need to know the answer.

239
00:13:09,477 --> 00:13:11,667
As the last prince of the former empire.

240
00:13:13,687 --> 00:13:17,757
The one who killed my brother
 was not from the empire.

241
00:13:18,827 --> 00:13:22,667
Back then, the castle was
 surrounded while I was absent.

242
00:13:22,667 --> 00:13:25,897
On the condition that my brother be spared,

243
00:13:25,897 --> 00:13:28,917
I entered the empire's service.

244
00:13:29,807 --> 00:13:34,547
However, our senior statesmen, who had given up
 fighting in the face of the empire's military power,

245
00:13:34,547 --> 00:13:37,297
blamed my brother to protect themselves.

246
00:13:38,197 --> 00:13:40,817
They decapitated him and
 offered his head to the empire.

247
00:13:42,877 --> 00:13:45,047
I was filled with regret.

248
00:13:45,047 --> 00:13:48,837
But that must have been our fate.

249
00:13:49,717 --> 00:13:56,847
My brother had fulfilled his fate as monarch,
 and I decided to devote myself to the fate,

250
00:13:56,847 --> 00:13:59,527
by keeping my pact with the empire.

251
00:14:00,267 --> 00:14:02,987
You're wrong!

252
00:14:03,367 --> 00:14:09,457
I know a girl who defies fate,
 no matter how cruel, and keeps fighting.

253
00:14:10,167 --> 00:14:14,547
I've been watching her fight on,
 despite her circumstances,

254
00:14:14,547 --> 00:14:18,587
without becoming conceited over being called a princess.

255
00:14:18,587 --> 00:14:19,837
So...

256
00:14:20,337 --> 00:14:23,127
The time for getting to know each other is over.

257
00:14:23,127 --> 00:14:25,807
Let's finish this, Master.

258
00:14:36,827 --> 00:14:37,947
What was that?

259
00:14:37,947 --> 00:14:41,747
Let's call it "Etching Strike."

260
00:14:42,377 --> 00:14:44,907
Consciousness is like breathing.

261
00:14:44,907 --> 00:14:50,367
No matter how much you concentrate, there are moments of discontinuity.

262
00:14:50,367 --> 00:14:52,487
I aim for that moment to strike.

263
00:14:53,397 --> 00:14:55,807
Do you understand now, Master?

264
00:14:55,807 --> 00:14:58,687
I'm doing this to keep my pact with the empire.

265
00:14:58,687 --> 00:15:00,427
Please don't think ill of me.

266
00:15:01,397 --> 00:15:04,067
My fight is not over!

267
00:15:04,067 --> 00:15:07,347
Even though the empire was destroyed, it still goes on!

268
00:15:08,717 --> 00:15:12,807
Just like you and your brother,
 who pursued your ideals!

269
00:15:27,787 --> 00:15:30,287
How did you...

270
00:15:30,967 --> 00:15:35,077
I managed to read your movements
 at the last moment.

271
00:15:35,077 --> 00:15:38,507
Because you gave yourself to emotions.

272
00:15:38,977 --> 00:15:43,217
I can't believe I, the heartless,
 still had that in me.

273
00:15:43,947 --> 00:15:48,427
In the past, I tried to save this kingdom and failed.

274
00:15:49,007 --> 00:15:52,247
I wanted to save as many people as I could.

275
00:15:52,247 --> 00:15:57,397
That's why I had the determination to destroy the Arcadia Empire.

276
00:15:58,267 --> 00:16:00,197
I'm appalled.

277
00:16:00,197 --> 00:16:04,987
To choose to destroy your own kingdom in order to save it...

278
00:16:05,367 --> 00:16:08,037
Looks like I've misunderstood you, Master.

279
00:16:08,037 --> 00:16:15,357
You've been fighting alone all this time
 for the sake of the Arcadia Empire.

280
00:16:16,627 --> 00:16:18,377
